pan>One tap from your phone<span class=\"sep\">·</span>Fully secured',\n    manifesto: 'Agents are entering every role. <b>Those who know how to manage them will lead.</b>',\n    tgName: 'Joni',\n    secH1: 'Secured, <span class=\"accent\">and yours only</span>',\n    secLead: \"Before you let an agent into your life, you deserve to know what happens with your data. Here is the promise, in five points.\",\n    sec1T: 'An isolated agent, on your own server', sec1B: 'Runs on an isolated NanoClaw server that belongs only to you, with no external access and no data mixing with anyone.',\n    sec2T: 'On Telegram, a closed encrypted channel', sec2B: 'Your single, most secure communication channel, fully separate from your email and drive.',\n    sec3T: 'No access to personal systems', sec3B: 'Email, drive and private accounts are blocked for it by configuration. That is a choice, not a temporary limitation.',\n    sec4T: 'External AI tools, through your keys', sec4B: 'Decks, video and content through your own keys, with one-click disconnect.',\n    sec5T: 'Full deletion, any time', sec5B: 'Delete the entire chat history and shut the agent down with a single click.',\n    soul: \"The mind of the world's most advanced AI, the body of NanoClaw, and the soul of Elia Ben Canaan.\",\n    installH1: 'How it is going to work',\n    installLead: 'Four steps, from the moment you click until your agent is working for you.',\n    st1T: 'Telegram, your private channel', st1B: 'Available as a mobile app, a desktop app, and in the browser. Fast, synced, and comfortable for work. Already have it? Skip to the next step.',\n    dlMobile: 'Download for mobile →', dlDesktop: 'Download for desktop →',\n    st2T: 'We open your personal account', st2B: 'Name, phone and email. They open an account that is yours alone, and no one else gets in, not even us.',\n    st3T: 'Your agent is built automatically', st3B: 'The moment you approve, an automatic setup of your personal agent begins. A minute or