בניתי תוכנית קליטה לשבועיים, שיבצתי פגישות היכרות ביומן עם האנשים הרלוונטיים, ורשמתי אותך למערכות. נתחיל?' },\n581\t        { who:'me',  text:'כן. ואיך פותחים בקשת רכש לציוד?' },\n582\t        { who:'bot', text:'יש טופס, אבל אני ממלא בשבילך. מה, כמה, ולמי' },\n583\t        { who:'me',  text:'3 מסכים, בערך 6000 שקל' },\n584\t        { who:'bot', text:'מילאתי, צירפתי הצדקה תקציבית, ושלחתי לאישור המנהל שלך. תגיע התראה כשיאושר. ריכזתי לך גם את כל תהליכי הקליטה במקום אחד.', file:'תוכנית_קליטה.pdf' }\n585\t      ],\n586\t      receipt: { title:'בוצע · 4 פעולות', rows:['תוכנית קליטה לשבועיים נבנתה','פגישות היכרות שובצו ביומן','נרשמת לכל המערכות','בקשת רכש נשלחה לאישור המנהל'] }\n587\t    },\n588\t    {\n589\t      base: [16,22],\n590\t      msgs: [\n591\t        { who:'me',  text:'כל שבוע יוצא כלי AI חדש, אני לא מצליח לעקוב' },\n592\t        { who:'bot', text:'אז לא צריך לעקוב. רק להגיד לי מה צריך, ואני בוחר את הכלי, מתחבר אליו, ומריץ. בלי ללמוד כלום' },\n593\t        { who:'me',  text:'צריך לנתח את הנתונים מהחודש ולהוציא תובנות' },\n594\t        { who:'bot', text:'על זה. בחרתי את הכלי המתאים, הרצתי, וזיהיתי 3 מגמות בולטות. מסדר דוח קריא עם המלצות' },\n595\t        { who:'me',  text:'תכין גם גרסה של עמוד אחד למנהלים' },\n596\t        { who:'bot', text:'הכנתי, עמוד אחד עם השורה התחתונה וההמלצה המרכזית.', file:'דוח_חודשי.pdf' }\n597\t      ],\n598\t      receipt: { title:'בוצע · 3 פעולות', rows:['הכלי המתאים נבחר והורץ','3 מגמות בולטות זוהו בנתונים','דוח מלא + עמוד מסכם למנהלים'] }\n599\t    }\n600\t  ],\n601\t  en: [\n602\t    {\n603\t      base: [9,12],\n604\t      msgs: [\n605\t        { who:'me',  text:'Update the client in the CRM, prepare a quote and send it by email' },\n606\t        { who:'bot', text:'What amount should the quote be for?' },\n607\t        { who:'me',  text:'45K, as we agreed in the meeting' },\n608\t        { who:'bot', text:'Updated the CRM, prepared the quote, and drafted an email to the client.' },\n609\t        { who:'bot', text:'The email is waiting for your approval. One click and it goes out.' }\n610\t      ],\n611\t      receipt: { title:'Done · 3 actions', rows:['Client updated in the CRM','A 45,000 quote is ready','Email draft awaiting your approval'] }\n612\t    },\n613\t    {\n614\t      base: [11,40],\n615\t      msgs: [\n616\t        { who:'me',  text:\"I need a deck that explains the new procedure to the team, for tomorrow morning's meeting\" },\n617\t        { who:'bot', text:'On it. I pulled the procedure from the doc you shared. Internal or client-facing, and how many slides?' },\n618\t        { who:'me',  text:'Internal, short and to the point' },\n619\t        { who:'bot', text:'Building: what changes, why, and what to do in practice, with an example for each step. 8 slides.', file:'Procedure_Deck.pptx' },\n620\t        { who:'me',  text:'Add something for the team to practice on' },\n621\t        { who:'bot', text:'Added a practice sheet with three scenarios. Everything is ready for the meeting.', file:'Practice_Sheet.pdf' }\n622\t      ],\n623\t      receipt: { title:'Done · 3 actions', rows:['Procedure pulled from the shared doc','An 8-slide deck was built','Practice sheet with three scenarios added'] }\n624\t    },\n625\t    {\n626\t      base: [13,5],\n627\t      msgs: [\n628\t        { who:'me',  text:'I started a new role today, I do not know the systems or the processes' },\n629\t        { who:'bot', text:'I will walk you through it. I built a two-week onboarding plan, scheduled intro meetings with the relevant people, and registered you to the systems. Shall we start?' },\n630\t        { who:'me',  text:'Yes. And how do I open a purchase request for equipment?' },\n631\t        { who:'bot', text:'There is a form, but I fill it in for you. What, how many, and for whom' },\n632\t        { who:'me',  text:'3 monitors, around 6,000' },\n633\t        { who:'bot', text:'Filled it in, attached a budget justification, and sent it to your manager for approval. A notification will arrive once it is approved. I also gathered all your onboarding into one place.', file:'Onboarding_Plan.pdf' }\n634\t      ],\n635\t      receipt: { title:'Done · 4 actions', rows:['Two-week onboarding plan built','Intro meetings scheduled in the calendar','Registered to all systems','Purchase request sent for manager approval'] }\n636\t    },\n637\t    {\n638\t      base: [16,22],\n639\t      msgs: [\n640\t        { who:'me',  text:'A new AI tool comes out every week, I cannot keep up' },\n641\t        { who:'bot', text:'Then there is no need to. Just tell me what you need, and I pick the tool, connect to it, and run it. Nothing to learn' },\n642\t        { who:'me',  text:'I need this month\\'s data analyzed, with insights' },\n643\t        { who:'bot', text:'On it. Picked the right tool, ran it, and spotted 3 clear trends. Putting together a readable report with recommendations' },\n644\t        { who:'me',  text:'Prepare a one-page version for management too' },\n645\t        { who:'bot', text:'Done, one page with the bottom line and the key recommendation.', file:'Monthly_Report.pdf' }\n646\t      ],\n647\t      receipt: { title:'Done · 3 actions', rows:['The right tool picked and run','3 clear trends identified in the data','Full report + a one-pager for management'] }\n648\t    }\n649\t  ]\n650\t};\n651\t\n652\tlet lang = 'he';\n653\tfunction T(){ return S[lang]; }\n654\tfunction SC(){ return SCEN[lang]; }\n655\t\n656\tfunction applyLang(){\n657\t  document.documentElement.lang = lang;\n658\t  document.documentElement.dir = lang === 'he' ? 'rtl' : 'ltr';\n659\t  document.title = T().docTitle;\n660\t  document.querySelectorAll('[data-i18n]').forEach(el=>{ el.textContent = T()[el.dataset.i18n]; });\n661\t  document.querySelectorAll('[data-i18n-html]').forEach(el=>{ el.innerHTML = T()[el.dataset.i18nHtml]; });\n662\t  document.querySelectorAll('[data-i18n-ph]').forEach(el=>{ el.placeholder = T()[el.dataset.i18nPh]; });\n663\t  document.getElementById('backBtn').setAttribute('aria-label', T().backAria);\n664\t  document.getElementById('tgName').textContent = T().tgName;\n665\t  updateDoneTitle();\n666\t  document.querySelectorAll('#langToggle button').forEach(b=>b.classList.toggle('on', b.dataset.lang===lang));\n667\t  render();\n668\t}\n669\t\n670\tdocument.querySelectorAll('#langToggle button').forEach(b=>{\n671\t  b.onclick = ()=>{\n672\t    if (b.dataset.lang === lang) return;\n673\t    lang = b.dataset.lang;\n674\t    applyLang();\n675\t    restartDemo();\n676\t  };\n677\t});\n678\t\n679\t/* ================= navigation ================= */\n680\tconst slides = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('.slide'));\n681\tconst N = slides.length;\n682\tlet current = 0;\n683\tlet userName = '';\n684\t\n685\tconst backBtn = document.getElementById('backBtn');\n686\tconst ctaBtn  = document.getElementById('ctaBtn');\n687\tconst swipeHint = document.getElementById('swipeHint');\n688\tconst ctaFoot = document.getElementById('ctaFoot');\n689\tconst dotsEl  = document.getElementById('dots');\n690\t\n691\tfor (let i = 0; i < N; i++) {\n692\t  const b = document.createElement('button');\n693\t  b.setAttribute('aria-label', 'screen ' + (i + 1));\n694\t  b.onclick = () => goTo(i);\n695\t  dotsEl.appendChild(b);\n696\t}\n697\tconst dots = Array.from(dotsEl.children);\n698\t\n699\tfunction render(){\n700\t  slides.forEach((s,i)=>{\n701\t    s.classList.toggle('active', i===current);\n702\t    s.classList.toggle('before', i>current);\n703\t  });\n704\t  dots.forEach((d,i)=>d.classList.toggle('on', i===current));\n705\t  backBtn.disabled = current===0;\n706\t  const c = T().cta[current];\n707\t  ctaBtn.textContent = c.label;\n708\t  swipeHint.style.display = c.hint ? 'flex' : 'none';\n709\t  ctaFoot.style.display = c.foot ? 'block' : 'none';\n710\t  ctaFoot.textContent = c.foot || '';\n711\t  if (current===1) demoEnter();\n712\t  if (current===2) securityEnter();\n713\t}\n714\t\n715\tfunction goTo(i){\n716\t  if (i<0 || i>=N || i===current) return;\n717\t  current = i;\n718\t  render();\n719\t}\n720\t\n721\tbackBtn.onclick = ()=>goTo(current-1);\n722\tctaBtn.onclick = ()=>{\n723\t  const a = T().cta[current].action;\n724\t  if (a==='next') goTo(current+1);\n725\t  else if (a==='submit') submitForm();\n726\t  else if (a==='telegram') window.open('https://t.me/Nanoco_pilot_bot','_blank');\n727\t};\n728\tdocument.getElementById('rescueLink').onclick = ()=>goTo(3);\n729\t\n730\tdocument.addEventListener('keydown', e=>{\n731\t  const rtl = document.documentElement.dir === 'rtl';\n732\t  const fwd = rtl ? 'ArrowLeft' : 'ArrowRight';\n733\t  const bck = rtl ? 'ArrowRight' : 'ArrowLeft';\n734\t  if (e.key===fwd) goTo(current+1);\n735\t  if (e.key===bck) goTo(current-1);\n736\t});\n737\t\n738\tlet touchX = null, touchY = null;\n739\tconst stage = document.getElementById('stage');\n740\tstage.addEventListener('touchstart', e=>{ touchX=e.touches[0].clientX; touchY=e.touches[0].clientY; }, {passive:true});\n741\tstage.addEventListener('touchend', e=>{\n742\t  if (touchX===null) return;\n743\t  const dx = e.changedTouches[0].clientX - touchX;\n744\t  const dy = e.changedTouches[0].clientY - touchY;\n745\t  if (Math.abs(dx)>48 && Math.abs(dx)>Math.abs(dy)*1.4){\n746\t    if (dx<0) goTo(current+1); else goTo(current-1); /* swipe-left = forward */\n747\t  }\n748\t  touchX = null;\n749\t}, {passive:true});\n750\t\n751\t/* ================= security reveal ================= */\n752\tlet secRevealed = false;\n753\tfunction securityEnter(){\n754\t  if (secRevealed) return;\n755\t  secRevealed = true;\n756\t  const items = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('.reveal-item'));\n757\t  items.forEach((el,i)=>{\n758\t    setTimeout(()=>el.classList.add('in'), 260 + i*430);\n759\t  });\n760\t}\n761\t\n762\t/* ================= signup ================= */\n763\tconst VALIDATORS = {\n764\t  fFirst: v => v.trim().length >= 2,\n765\t  fLast:  v => v.trim().length >= 2,\n766\t  fEmail: v => /^[^\\s@]+@[^\\s@]+\\.[^\\s@]{2,}$/.test(v.trim()),\n767\t  fPhone: v => /^[\\d+\\-\\s()]{9,15}$/.test(v.trim())\n768\t};\n769\t\n770\tfunction validateField(wrapId){\n771\t  const wrap = document.getElementById(wrapId);\n772\t  const input = wrap.querySelector('input');\n773\t  const valid = VALIDATORS[wrapId](input.value);\n774\t  wrap.classList.toggle('invalid', !valid);\n775\t  return valid;\n776\t}\n777\t\n778\t/* errors appear only after the user touches a field (blur) or tries to submit */\n779\tObject.keys(VALIDATORS).forEach(wrapId=>{\n780\t  const wrap = document.getElementById(wrapId);\n781\t  const input = wrap.querySelector('input');\n782\t  input.addEventListener('blur', ()=>{ if (input.value.trim() !== '') validateField(wrapId); });\n783\t  input.addEventListener('input', ()=>{ if (wrap.classList.contains('invalid')) validateField(wrapId); });\n784\t});\n785\tdocument.getElementById('inConsent').addEventListener('change', e=>{\n786\t  if (e.target.checked) document.getElementById('consentWrap').classList.remove('invalid');\n787\t});\n788\t\n789\tfunction updateDoneTitle(){\n790\t  const el = document.getElementById('doneTitle');\n791\t  el.textContent = userName ? T().doneTitleName.replace('{name}', userName) : T().doneTitle;\n792\t}\n793\t\n794\tfunction submitForm(){\n795\t  let ok = true;\n796\t  Object.keys(VALIDATORS).forEach(wrapId=>{ if (!validateField(wrapId)) ok = false; });\n797\t  const consent = document.getElementById('inConsent');\n798\t  document.getElementById('consentWrap').classList.toggle('invalid', !consent.checked);\n799\t  if (!consent.checked) ok = false;\n800\t  if (!ok){\n801\t    const firstInvalid = document.querySelector('.field.invalid input');\n802\t    if (firstInvalid) firstInvalid.focus();\n803\t    return;\n804\t  }\n805\t  userName = document.getElementById('inFirst').value.trim();\n806\t  ctaBtn.disabled = true;\n807\t  ctaBtn.textContent = T().submitting;\n808\t  setTimeout(()=>{\n809\t    ctaBtn.disabled = false;\n810\t    updateDoneTitle();\n811\t    goTo(5);\n812\t  }, 1400);\n813\t}\n814\t\n815\t/* ================= telegram demo: auto simulation, watch-it-happen ================= */\n816\tconst chatLog = document.getElementById('chatLog');\n817\tconst tgStatus = document.getElementById('tgStatus');\n818\t\n819\tconst CHECK_TEAL = '<svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#56EDD6\" stroke-width=\"2.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M20 6L9 17l-5-5\"/></svg>';\n820\tconst DBL_CHECK = '<svg width=\"15\" height=\"11\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 12\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M1 6.5L4.5 10 11 2.5\"/><path d=\"M8 6.5L11.5 10 18 2.5\"/></svg>';\n821\tconst DOC_ICON = '<svg width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"1.9\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M14 2H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v16a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2V7z\"/><path d=\"M14 2v5h5\"/></svg>';\n822\t\n823\tlet demoStarted = false;\n824\tlet demoGen = 0;\n825\tlet msgClock = null;\n826\t\n827\tfunction wait(ms){ return new Promise(res=>setTimeout(res, ms)); }\n828\tfunction step(gen){ if (gen !== demoGen) throw new Error('stale'); }\n829\tasync function waitVisible(gen){\n830\t  step(gen);\n831\t  while (current !== 1){ await wait(400); step(gen); }\n832\t}\n833\t\n834\tfunction fmtTime(){\n835\t  if (!msgClock) return '';\n836\t  const t = msgClock.h.toString() + ':' + (msgClock.m<10?'0':'') + msgClock.m;\n837\t  msgClock.m += 1;\n838\t  if (msgClock.m>59){ msgClock.m=0; msgClock.h=(msgClock.h+1)%24; }\n839\t  return t;\n840\t}\n841\t\n842\tfunction scrollLog(){ chatLog.scrollTop = chatLog.scrollHeight; }\n843\t\n844\tfunction bubble(who, html, withStamp){\n845\t  const row = document.createElement('div');\n846\t  row.className = 'msg-row ' + who;\n847\t  const b = document.createElement('div');\n848\t  b.className = 'bubble';\n849\t  b.innerHTML = html;\n850\t  if (withStamp){\n851\t    const st = document.createElement('div');\n852\t    st.className = 'stamp';\n853\t    st.innerHTML = (who==='me' ? DBL_CHECK : '') + '<span>' + fmtTime() + '</span>';\n854\t    b.appendChild(st);\n855\t  }\n856\t  row.appendChild(b);\n857\t  chatLog.appendChild(row);\n858\t  scrollLog();\n859\t  return row;\n860\t}\n861\t\n862\tfunction docHtml(name){\n863\t  const kind = name.split('.').pop().toUpperCase();\n864\t  return '<div class=\"doc\"><div class=\"doc-ic\">' + DOC_ICON + '</div><div><div class=\"doc-name\">' + name + '</div><div class=\"doc-kind\">' + kind + '</div></div></div>';\n865\t}\n866\t\n867\tfunction typingOn(){\n868\t  tgStatus.textContent = 'typing…';\n869\t  tgStatus.classList.add('typing');\n870\t  const row = document.createElement('div');\n871\t  row.className = 'msg-row bot typing-row';\n872\t  row.innerHTML = '<div class=\"bubble typing-bubble\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>';\n873\t  chatLog.appendChild(row);\n874\t  scrollLog();\n875\t  return row;\n876\t}\n877\tfunction typingOff(row){\n878\t  tgStatus.textContent = 'online';\n879\t  tgStatus.classList.remove('typing');\n880\t  if (row && row.parentNode) row.remove();\n881\t}\n882\t\n883\tasync function botSays(gen, html, quick){\n884\t  await waitVisible(gen);\n885\t  const t = typingOn();\n886\t  await wait(quick ? 650 : 1050);\n887\t  step(gen);\n888\t  typingOff(t);\n889\t  return bubble('bot', html, true);\n890\t}\n891\t\n892\tasync function playScenario(gen, idx){\n893\t  const sc = SC()[idx];\n894\t  msgClock = { h: sc.base[0], m: sc.base[1] };\n895\t  for (const m of sc.msgs){\n896\t    await waitVisible(gen);\n897\t    if (m.who==='me'){\n898\t      await wait(750); step(gen);\n899\t      bubble('me', m.text + (m.file ? docHtml(m.file) : ''), true);\n900\t    } else {\n901\t      const t = typingOn();\n902\t      await wait(1150); step(gen);\n903\t      typingOff(t);\n904\t      bubble('bot', (m.file ? docHtml(m.file) : '') + m.text, true);\n905\t    }\n906\t  }\n907\t  /* receipt as a telegram-style bot message */\n908\t  await wait(500); step(gen);\n909\t  const t = typingOn();\n910\t  await wait(800); step(gen);\n911\t  typingOff(t);\n912\t  let html = '<div class=\"receipt-head\">' + CHECK_TEAL + '<span>' + sc.receipt.title + '</span></div>';\n913\t  sc.receipt.rows.forEach(r=>{ html += '<div class=\"receipt-row\">' + CHECK_TEAL + '<span>' + r + '</span></div>'; });\n914\t  bubble('bot', html, true);\n915\t}\n916\t\n917\tasync function fadeClear(gen){\n918\t  chatLog.style.transition = 'opacity .45s ease';\n919\t  chatLog.style.opacity = '0';\n920\t  await wait(480); step(gen);\n921\t  chatLog.innerHTML = '';\n922\t  chatLog.style.opacity = '1';\n923\t}\n924\t\n925\tasync function runLoop(gen){\n926\t  try {\n927\t    await wait(500);\n928\t    while (true){\n929\t      await botSays(gen, T().demoGreeting);\n930\t      await wait(1500);\n931\t      for (let i = 0; i < SC().length; i++){\n932\t        await playScenario(gen, i);\n933\t        await wait(2400); step(gen);\n934\t        if (i < SC().length - 1){ await fadeClear(gen); }\n935\t      }\n936\t      await botSays(gen, T().demoClosing, true);\n937\t      await wait(5200); step(gen);\n938\t      await fadeClear(gen);\n939\t    }\n940\t  } catch(e){ /* stale generation: a newer run owns the stage */ }\n941\t}\n942\t\n943\tfunction restartDemo(){\n944\t  demoGen++;\n945\t  chatLog.innerHTML = '';\n946\t  chatLog.style.opacity = '1';\n947\t  tgStatus.textContent = 'online';\n948\t  tgStatus.classList.remove('typing');\n949\t  if (demoStarted) runLoop(demoGen);\n950\t}\n951\t\n952\tfunction demoEnter(){\n953\t  if (demoStarted) return;\n954\t  demoStarted = true;\n955\t  runLoop(++demoGen);\n956\t}\n957\t\n958\tapplyLang();\n959\t</script>\n960\t</body>\n961\t</html>\n962\t"}]},"uuid":"edb8b979-d2f0-417d-94a0-5bddaaff4f97","timestamp":"2026-07-02T19:36:32.381Z","toolUseResult":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/workspace/agent/ux-review/shellano-v4.template.html","content":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"he\" dir=\"rtl\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>NanoShellano · מוקאפ v4</title>\n<style>\n  :root{\n    --bg:#000000; --surface:#101010; --surface2:#181818;\n    --text:#FFFFFF; --muted:#B0B0B0; --teal:#56EDD6; --teal-dim:#1F4A43; --teal-line:#2A6B5F;\n    --orange:#E85D3A; --border:#3A3A3A;\n    /* telegram replica palette (inside chat only) */\n    --tg-bg:#1a2332; --tg-header:#212d44;\n    --tg-in:#212d3b; --tg-out-a:#4f6bE8; --tg-out-b:#3f7be8;\n    --tg-input:#161e2b;\n  }\n  *{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}\n  html,body{height:100%}\n  body{\n    background:var(--bg); color:var(--text);\n    font-family:'Inter','Segoe UI',system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;\n    display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; justify-content:center;\n    min-height:100dvh; gap:10px; padding:8px 0;\n  }\n  .caption{color:#5a5a5a;font-size:11.5px;letter-spacing:.4px}\n\n  /* ---------- phone frame ---------- */\n  .phone{\n    position:relative; width:min(410px,100vw); height:min(860px,calc(100dvh - 56px));\n    background:var(--bg); border:1px solid #262626; border-radius:24px;\n    overflow:hidden; display:flex; flex-direction:column;\n  }\n  @media (max-width:430px){ .phone{border:none;border-radius:0;height:100dvh} body{padding:0} .caption{display:none} }\n\n  /* ---------- app header: back + logo on start side, lang toggle on end side ---------- */\n  .app-header{\n    flex:0 0 auto; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between;\n    gap:10px; padding:14px 16px 10px;\n  }\n  .header-side{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px}\n  .back-btn{\n    width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:50%;border:1px solid var(--border);\n    background:var(--surface);color:var(--muted);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\n    cursor:pointer;flex:0 0 auto;transition:opacity .2s,border-color .2s;