{"parentUuid":"4105cb93-5c08-44b0-add0-1116d75c7b68","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"3b2a39ff-aff2-4762-87a5-910f270cc313","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01J6A8HBQM8sYPdJMwAZomrG","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Clerk SMS phone verification pricing Next.js OTP 2026\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"PhoneNumber - Types - Next.js | Clerk Docs\",\"url\":\"https://clerk.com/docs/nextjs/reference/types/phone-number\"},{\"title\":\"Custom Flows: Build a custom email or SMS OTP authentication flow\",\"url\":\"https://clerk.com/docs/custom-flows/email-sms-otp\"},{\"title\":\"Build a custom email or phone OTP authentication flow (Legacy) - Legacy APIs | Clerk Docs\",\"url\":\"https://clerk.com/docs/guides/development/custom-flows/authentication/legacy/email-sms-otp\"},{\"title\":\"Build a custom sign-in flow with email or phone code - Authentication | Clerk Docs\",\"url\":\"https://clerk.com/docs/guides/development/custom-flows/authentication/email-sms-otp\"},{\"title\":\"Firebase Auth Pricing 2026: Complete Cost Guide | Free Tier, SMS & Enterprise SSO\",\"url\":\"https://www.metacto.com/blogs/the-complete-guide-to-firebase-auth-costs-setup-integration-and-maintenance\"},{\"title\":\"Sign-up and sign-in options - Authentication strategies | Clerk Docs\",\"url\":\"https://clerk.com/docs/guides/configure/auth-strategies/sign-up-sign-in-options\"},{\"title\":\"Test emails and phones - Testing with Clerk | Clerk Docs\",\"url\":\"https://clerk.com/docs/guides/development/testing/test-emails-and-phones\"},{\"title\":\"Pricing — Free Up to 50K Users | Plans from $0/mo\",\"url\":\"https://clerk.com/pricing\"},{\"title\":\"SMS passcodes\",\"url\":\"https://clerk.com/glossary/sms-passcodes\"}]\n\nI've found relevant information about Clerk SMS phone verification and OTP in Next.js. Here's what I discovered:\n\n## Clerk SMS Phone Verification and OTP in Next.js\n\n**Core Functionality:**\nThe verification process always starts with the prepareVerification() method, which will send an OTP via an SMS message. The second and final step involves an attempt to complete the verification by calling the attemptVerification() method, passing the OTP as a parameter.\n\n**Phone Number Verification:**\nUsers can authenticate with their phone number and verify it with an OTP. During sign in, users can opt in to an extra verification step where they will receive an SMS message with an OTP. This OTP must be entered to complete the sign in process.\n\n**Geographic Restrictions:**\nSMS functionality, including SMS OTPs, is restricted to phone numbers from countries that are enabled on your SMS allowlist. By default, only the US and Canada are enabled.\n\n**Pricing:**\nClerk pricing starts free for up to 50,000 monthly retained users. Pro plans from $20/mo. For a pricing comparison, at 50K MAUs: Firebase ($0), Cognito ($0), Clerk (~$800), Auth0 (~$1,200). At 100K MAUs: Firebase ($275), Cognito ($275), Clerk (~$1,200), Auth0 (~$2,400).\n\n**Development Testing:**\nIf Clerk is used to deliver SMS messages and/or emails for your development instance, a maximum of 20 SMS messages and 100 emails can be delivered per calendar month. After that, requests resulting in SMS and/or email OTPs will be rejected.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"37d4ca78-cb5b-4574-866f-49ba92eae7fe","timestamp":"2026-07-03T06:33:36.855Z","toolUseResult":{"query":"Clerk SMS phone verification pricing Next.js OTP 2026","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_019BQLH4m1WtrE2UQ8y3x6U1","content":[{"title":"PhoneNumber - Types - Next.js | Clerk Docs","url":"https://clerk.com/docs/nextjs/reference/types/phone-number"},{"title":"Custom Flows: Build a custom email or SMS OTP authentication flow","url":"https://clerk.com/docs/custom-flows/email-sms-otp"},{"title":"Build a custom email or phone OTP authentication flow (Legacy) - Legacy APIs | Clerk Docs","url":