nthly retained users. Pro plans from $20/mo. For a pricing comparison, at 50K MAUs: Firebase ($0), Cognito ($0), Clerk (~$800), Auth0 (~$1,200). At 100K MAUs: Firebase ($275), Cognito ($275), Clerk (~$1,200), Auth0 (~$2,400).\n\n**Development Testing:**\nIf Clerk is used to deliver SMS messages and/or emails for your development instance, a maximum of 20 SMS messages and 100 emails can be delivered per calendar month. After that, requests resulting in SMS and/or email OTPs will be rejected."],"durationSeconds":8.767581450000172,"searchCount":1},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"4105cb93-5c08-44b0-add0-1116d75c7b68","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"/workspace/agent","sessionId":"0bec9074-f0ee-4108-82bf-5bb584ae73da","version":"2.1.197","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"polished-jumping-turing"}
