{"parentUuid":"ecdc047a-de01-4d89-a015-6a17148a52b1","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"3b2a39ff-aff2-4762-87a5-910f270cc313","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_016JiLZf9oj7shQz7f6vtGDw","type":"tool_result","content":"# Israel SMS Guidelines Summary\n\n## Alphanumeric Sender IDs\nIsrael **does not support international alphanumeric sender IDs** through Twilio. However, domestic pre-registration is supported with approximately 1 week provisioning time. Content restrictions apply: \"Content related to gambling, politics, drugs, pornography, and adult material is prohibited.\"\n\n## OTP SMS Pre-Registration\nFor one-time password messages to Israel, you'll need to complete domestic pre-registration. The process takes about a week to get operator approval.\n\n## Two-Way SMS Support\nYes, Israel supports two-way SMS messaging through Twilio's platform.\n\n## Additional Constraints\n- Long codes can send internationally, but \"International traffic submitted over local long codes is actively blocked by the operators\"\n- Short codes are not supported in Israel\n- SMS cannot be sent to landline numbers; the API returns a 400 error"}]},"uuid":"e505346f-629c-448a-8fe9-e4123e2c7df4","timestamp":"2026-07-03T06:33:57.750Z","toolUseResult":{"bytes":601059,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"# Israel SMS Guidelines Summary\n\n## Alphanumeric Sender IDs\nIsrael **does not support international alphanumeric sender IDs** through Twilio. However, domestic pre-registration is supported with approximately 1 week provisioning time. Content restrictions apply: \"Content related to gambling, politics, drugs, pornography, and adult material is prohibited.\"\n\n## OTP SMS Pre-Registration\nFor one-time password messages to Israel, you'll need to complete domestic pre-registration. The process takes about a week to get operator approval.\n\n## Two-Way SMS Support\nYes, Israel supports two-way SMS messaging through Twilio's platform.\n\n## Additional Constraints\n- Long codes can send internationally, but \"International traffic submitted over local long codes is actively blocked by the operators\"\n- Short codes are not supported in Israel\n- SMS cannot be sent to landline numbers; the API returns a 400 error","durationMs":4184,"url":"https://www.twilio.com/en-us/guidelines/il/sms"},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"ecdc047a-de01-4d89-a015-6a17148a52b1","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"/workspace/agent","sessionId":"0bec9074-f0ee-4108-82bf-5bb584ae73da","version":"2.1.197","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"polished-jumping-turing"}
