{"type":"queue-operation","operation":"enqueue","timestamp":"2026-07-03T19:33:40.951Z","sessionId":"0bec9074-f0ee-4108-82bf-5bb584ae73da","content":"<context timezone=\"UTC\" />\n<message id=\"76\" from=\"parent\" sender=\"Unknown\" time=\"Jul 3, 2026, 7:33 PM\">משימה מאליה: לשדרג את הקופי האנגלי של האפליקציה החיה (nano.html) לאנגלית נייטיב, מודרנית, זורמת וסופר-מקצועית. זה הקופי שמשתמשים אמיתיים יקראו — הרמה צריכה להיות של מוצר SaaS מוביל, לא תרגום.\n\n**מה לעשות:** קח את אובייקט ה-`en` למטה ושכתב כל מחרוזת לאנגלית מלוטשת — ברורה, בטוחה, אנושית, בלי קלישאות שיווקיות ובלי ריח של AI. שמור על הטון של אליה (אישי, ישיר, &quot;I built this to bring you across&quot;).\n\n**כללים קשיחים — אל תשבור אותם אחרת זה לא ייכנס לקוד:**\n- שמור על כל מפתח (key) בדיוק כמו שהוא. אל תוסיף, תמחק או תשנה שמות מפתחות.\n- שמור על מבנה הנתונים בדיוק: מחרוזות נשארות מחרוזות, מערכים נשארים מערכים באותו אורך וסדר (כל שלב/פיצ'ר/תסריט צ'אט במקומו).\n- שמור על כל תגי ה-HTML כמו שהם: `&lt;br&gt;`, `&lt;b&gt;...&lt;/b&gt;`, `&lt;span class=&quot;em&quot;&gt;...&lt;/span&gt;`, וקישורי ה-`&lt;a class=&quot;tlink&quot; onclick=&quot;...&quot;&gt;` — אפשר לשכתב את הטקסט **בתוך** התג, אבל אל תיגע במבנה התג, ב-onclick או ב-class.\n- שמור על ה-placeholders (s6_name_ph וכו') קצרים וטבעיים.\n- **אסור מקפים ארוכים (em-dash) בכלל.** פסיק, נקודה או ניסוח מחדש.\n- שמות מותג נשארים: NanoShellano, NanoClaw, Telegram, Joni.\n- פרטי קשר נשארים מדויקים: 052-8738698 · elia@bencnaan.net.\n\n**מה להחזיר:** את אובייקט ה-`en` המלא, מלוטש, כבלוק JS מוכן-להדבקה (אותו פורמט בדיוק), כדי שאשלב אותו ישר בקובץ. בלי הסברים מסביב, רק הבלוק.\n\n```js\nen:{\n  s1_kick:'NanoShellano',\n  s1_title:'The world of work&lt;br&gt;is changing. Now.',\n  s1_p:[\n    'Every month that passes, AI agents enter another department, another role, another desk. This is no longer the future, it is the present.',\n    'Whoever learns to work with an agent will be &lt;b&gt;one step ahead of everyone&lt;/b&gt;. Whoever does not, will keep doing by hand what an agent does in seconds.',\n    'The most important step you take this year is to open one agent of your own, and start working with it. &lt;span class=&quot;em&quot;&gt;No technical background, no code.&lt;/span&gt;'\n  ],\n  s1_cta:'I want into this world →',\n  s1_note:'Invite-only pilot · First version',\n  s1_by:'By Elia Ben Cnaan',\n\n  s2_kick:'Why free',\n  s2_title:'And why I give&lt;br&gt;this for free',\n  s2_p:[\n    'A year ago I could not write a single line of code. Today I have agents that do half my work for me, and it completely changed the way I work.',\n    'So instead of keeping it to myself, I built a simple way to bring you across to the other side too. &lt;b&gt;Without paying a cent.&lt;/b&gt;',\n    'This is a pilot I run to bring as many people as possible into the world of agents. No credit card, no commitment, no catch.'\n  ],\n  s2_cta:'Nice, what about privacy? →',\n  s2_note:'No hidden cost. The pilot is open and free.',\n\n  s3_kick:'Secure',\n  s3_title:'Secure, and only yours',\n  s3_lead:'Before you let an agent into your life, you deserve to know exactly what happens with your data.',\n  s3_sic:'🔒',\n  s3_sec_t:'An isolated account, only yours',\n  s3_sec:'The agent lives in a separate, isolated account dedicated to you alone. Every connection is encrypted, and your data does not mix with anyone.',\n  s3_f:[\n    ['🔑','You approve every connection','No service connects unless you tap &quot;approve&quot;, in your own account. You connect only what you want.'],\n    ['🚪','Disconnect and delete anytime','One tap disconnects a service, and one tap deletes the agent and all its data with it.'],\n    ['🛡️','Not sold, not shared','Your data is not sold and does not pass to anyone. It stays with you.']\n  ],\n  s3_honest:'&lt;b&gt;Honestly:&lt;/b&gt; this is not a promise that &quot;we have no access.&quot; It is real control, you decide, you approve, and you revoke whenever you want.',\n  s3_nano_link:'What is NanoClaw, actually?',\n  s3_cta:'Got it, how does it go? →',\n  s3_note:'You can chat with the agent in any language, Hebrew or English.',\n\n  s4_kick:'The path',\n  s4_title:'How it is going to be',\n  s4_lead:'Five steps from the moment you tap &quot;start&quot; until the agent works for you.',\n  s4_flow:[\n    ['Open your account','Name, phone, email. Takes a minute.'],\n    ['Your personal agent is set up','The system sets up an agent on a managed server, always on, only yours.'],\n    ['Get a code to Telegram','A personal link that connects the agent straight to your Telegram.'],\n    ['Step into the chat','The agent greets you by name, and you start talking in plain language.'],\n    ['Connect tools, when you want','Email, calendar, WhatsApp. Connect at your own pace, with one tap.']\n  ],\n  s4_cta:'And what does it actually do? →',\n  s4_note:'It all happens in a few minutes. You just follow the screens.',\n\n  s5_how_t:'This is how we\\'ll work',\n  s5_agent:'Joni',\n  s5_typing:'Online now',\n  s5_cases:[\n    {t:'Cross-system tasks', s:'One request turns into a chain of actions across several systems, and comes back to you done.',\n     c:[['me','Update the client in the CRM, prepare a quote and email it to them'],\n        ['bot','What amount is the quote for?'],\n        ['me','45K, as we agreed in the meeting'],\n        ['bot','Updated the CRM, prepared a quote, and drafted an email to the client.'],\n        ['bot','The email is waiting for your approval. Go in and approve sending.']]},\n    {t:'Produces deliverables', s:'Not just answers, it produces the deliverables themselves. Reports, decks, documents and analyses.',\n     c:[['me','I need a 10-slide deck on the Q2 results, for a 3pm meeting'],\n        ['bot','In our branding or the client\\'s?'],\n        ['me','Ours, with the new clients\\' logos'],\n        ['bot','Building: intro, 7 chart slides and a summary with recommendations.'],\n        ['bot','Ready, attached.','Q2_deck.pptx']]},\n    {t:'An onboarding colleague', s:'New in the role? It is the colleague that walks you through, step by step.',\n     c:[['me','New in the role. How do I open a purchase request?'],\n        ['bot','On it. I\\'ll open a request in the CRM and fill in the details per policy. For what amount?'],\n        ['me','An office equipment order, budget 6000'],\n        ['bot','Filled it in and sent it for the manager\\'s approval. Wait for the approval email.']]},\n    {t:'Keeps up with AI tools', s:'A new AI tool every week, impossible to keep up. So it keeps up for you.',\n     c:[['me','I need a training video for the new office procedures'],\n        ['bot','A new tool just came out that builds videos from photos of the office and people. Got any images?'],\n        ['me','Attaching photos of the team and the office','team_photos.zip'],\n        ['bot','Done. Uploaded the video to Drive and sent it for the manager\\'s approval.']]}\n  ],\n  s5_cta:'So, what do we promise? →',\n  s5_note:'Pick a scenario to see how it looks in a real conversation.',\n\n  s6_kick:'Install',\n  s6_title:'The install, then the magic',\n  s6_lead:'Three minutes. We open your account, you get a code to Telegram, &lt;b&gt;and from there the magic begins.&lt;/b&gt;',\n  s6_steps:[['1','Fill in details'],['2','Get a Telegram code'],['3','The magic begins']],\n  s6_name:'Full name', s6_name_ph:'What is your name',\n  s6_phone:'Phone', s6_phone_ph:'050-0000000',\n  s6_email:'Email', s6_email_ph:'you@example.com',\n  s6_check:'I have read and accept the &lt;a class=&quot;tlink&quot; onclick=&quot;event.stopPropagation();openSheet(\\'priv\\')&quot;&gt;terms of use and privacy&lt;/a&gt;. This approval opens the agent.',\n  s6_cta:'Open my agent →', s6_cta_load:'Opening your agent…',\n  s6_note:'Details are saved so the agent greets you right. No spam.',\n\n  magic_t:'Your agent is ready ✨',\n  magic_p:'We opened Telegram for you. The agent is &lt;b&gt;waiting there&lt;/b&gt;, just say hello.',\n  magic_peek:'Hey! 👋 I am your Nano, ready to start. What shall we dive into first?',\n\n  sheet_nano_t:'What is NanoClaw?',\n  sheet_nano:[\n    '&lt;b&gt;NanoClaw&lt;/b&gt; is the agent infrastructure everything runs on. A personal agent that lives on a managed server, always on, and talks with you through Telegram in plain language.',\n    'The agent is yours, not a company\\'s. It learns what you need, performs tasks, and can connect to your systems when you want, always under your control.',\n    'This pilot is the simplest way to open such an agent, with no technical background and no settings.'\n  ],\n  sheet_priv_t:'Terms of use &amp; privacy',\n  sheet_priv:[\n    '&lt;b&gt;Pilot.&lt;/b&gt; This service is an experimental pilot, provided for free, for a period of about one month at this stage. We may change, extend, pause or discontinue it at any time, without prior notice and with no commitment to continued availability.',\n    '&lt;b&gt;What we collect.&lt;/b&gt; Details you provide at signup (name, phone, email), the content of your conversations with the agent, and data from services you choose to connect, only after you approve each connection yourself.',\n    '&lt;b&gt;Why.&lt;/b&gt; The data is used to set up and run your personal agent, greet you correctly, and operate the service. Nothing else.',\n    '&lt;b&gt;Where it is stored.&lt;/b&gt; The agent lives in a separate, isolated account dedicated to you alone. Connections are encrypted, and your data does not mix with other users.',\n    '&lt;b&gt;Sharing.&lt;/b&gt; We do not sell or share your data. To make the service work it runs on third-party infrastructure (a managed server, Telegram, and AI model providers) that process data only to operate the service.',\n    '&lt;b&gt;Control and deletion.&lt;/b&gt; You are in full control. To delete everything, simply send the agent the delete command (for example &quot;delete and exit&quot;), and it wipes your entire chat history and stops working. You can then delete the contact in Telegram, and the agent will no longer respond. You can always contact us to request deletion too.',\n    '&lt;b&gt;Retention.&lt;/b&gt; Data is kept while your agent is active, or until you delete it. If the pilot ends, we will delete the data accordingly.',\n    '&lt;b&gt;No warranty.&lt;/b&gt; This is an experimental service provided as is. There is no guarantee of continuous availability, and it should not be relied on for critical uses or sensitive data.',\n    '&lt;b&gt;Age.&lt;/b&gt; Use is intended for those aged 18 and over.',\n    '&lt;b&gt;Changes.&lt;/b&gt; We may update these terms from time to time. Continued use constitutes acceptance of the updated version.',\n    '&lt;b&gt;Contact.&lt;/b&gt; For any question: 052-8738698 · elia@bencnaan.net'\n  ],\n  sheet_close:'Got it'\n}\n```</message>"}
