y time', sec5B: 'You can delete the entire chat history and fully shut the agent down with a single click, leaving nothing behind.',\n    soul: 'The mind of AI, the body of NanoClaw, and the soul of <span class=\"accent\">Elia Ben Cnaan</span>.',\n    pilH1: 'Ten days <span class=\"accent\">in the new world</span>',\n    pilLead: 'The world of work is changing before our eyes, and I want you to feel it for yourselves.',\n    pil1T: 'Completely free', pil1B: 'Ten days on me, from my own resources, so you can simply try it.',\n    pil2T: 'Enough time to get to know it', pil2B: 'Ten days is exactly the time to get used to the agent and see how it changes your day.',\n    pil3T: 'And from there, yours', pil3B: 'Once you feel the difference, you set up your own agent and carry on.',\n    pilSoul: 'Yours, <span class=\"accent\">Elia Ben Cnaan</span>.',\n    installH1: 'How it is going to work',\n    installLead: 'Four steps, from the moment you click until your agent is working for you.',\n    st1T: 'Telegram, your private channel', st1B: 'Available as a mobile app, a desktop app, and in the browser. Fast, synced, and comfortable for work. Already have it? Skip to the next step.',\n    dlMobile: 'Download for mobile →', dlDesktop: 'Download for desktop →',\n    st2T: 'We open your personal account', st2B: 'Name, phone and email. They open an account that is yours alone, and no one else gets in, not even us.',\n    st3T: 'Your agent is built automatically', st3B: 'The moment you approve, an automatic setup of your personal agent begins. A minute or two, and we make sure everything is ready and tuned just for you.',\n    st4T: 'The first conversation, on Telegram', st4B: 'The agent opens in your Telegram, introduces itself, and from there it is just a conversation.',\n    pilotH1: \"Preparing for the new world of work\",\n    pilotLead: \"I'm offering you a hands-on experience with an AI agent — free, for ten days.\",\n    pl1T: \"What exactly is this pilot?\", pl1B: \"You'